    "production_scope": "The only non-test Rust behavior change in these nine files is private canonical-string allocation retention within the existing complete-root arithmetic pool.",
    "publication": [
      "The builder borrows its owner exclusively; prior material is read during input collection while current leaves, pending strings, prior-use flags and the lazy allocation index remain operation-local.",
